content.text:
### Overview

Below is a **lightweight, production-ready static site** using **plain HTML + CSS + vanilla JS** (no frameworks).  
Structure:

- `index.html` → Main Big 3 calculator (`/`)
- `rising-sign-calculator.html` → Rising page (`/rising-sign-calculator`)
- `moon-sign-calculator.html` → Moon page (`/moon-sign-calculator`)
- `sun-sign-calculator.html` → Sun page (`/sun-sign-calculator`)
- `about.html` → `/about`
- `privacy-policy.html` → `/privacy-policy`
- `styles.css` → shared styling
- `app.js` → calculator + UI interactions

For real astrology math, you’ll plug in a proper calculation library/API later. The JS below uses a **placeholder deterministic mapping** so the UI works.

---

### `styles.css` (shared, dark gradient, responsive, fast)

```css
:root {
  --bg-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at top, #26284a 0%, #080812 55%, #050509 100%);
  --accent: #ffb347;
  --accent-soft: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.12);
  --accent-strong: #ffcf70;
  --accent-blue: #6ea8ff;
  --text-main: #f7f7ff;
  --text-muted: #9a9ab5;
  --card-bg: rgba(18, 20, 46, 0.9);
  --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  --input-bg: rgba(12, 14, 36, 0.95);
  --input-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  --input-border-focus: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.7);
  --shadow-soft: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  --radius-lg: 18px;
  --radius-pill: 999px;
  --transition-fast: 160ms ease-out;
  --transition-med: 220ms ease-out;
  --nav-height: 68px;
  --max-width: 1120px;
  --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text",
    "Inter", "Roboto", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}

*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  color: var(--text-main);
  background: #050509;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 186, 120, 0.12) 0, transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(108, 178, 255, 0.18) 0, transparent 60%),
    var(--bg-gradient);
  background-attachment: fixed;
}

/* Layout */

.site-shell {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.site-main {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 16px 16px 40px;
}

.site-main-inner {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--max-width);
}

/* Header */

.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  background: linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    rgba(3, 4, 19, 0.96),
    rgba(3, 4, 19, 0.86),
    transparent
  );
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

.site-header-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-width);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}

.site-logo {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.site-logo-mark {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: conic-gradient(
    from 200deg,
    #ffcf70,
    #ff8a5c,
    #8c6eff,
    #5bd6ff,
    #ffcf70
  );
  box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 186, 120, 0.8);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.site-logo-mark::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 4px;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, #fff4da 0, transparent 40%);
  opacity: 0.7;
}

.site-logo-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.site-logo-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 650;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.site-logo-sub {
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* Nav */

.site-nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.site-nav a {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: color var(--transition-fast), background var(--transition-fast),
    border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
}

.site-nav a:hover {
  color: var(--text-main);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.site-nav a.nav-primary {
  color: #050509;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcf70, #ff8a5c);
  border-color: transparent;
  font-weight: 600;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
}

.site-nav a.nav-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px) scale(1.01);
}

.site-nav a.nav-active {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  border-color: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.6);
  background: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.06);
}

/* Hero / tool layout */

.hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
  gap: 28px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.hero-copy {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 18px;
}

.hero-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-strong);
}

.hero-eyebrow-pill {
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  background: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.5);
}

.hero-eyebrow-dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #5bd6ff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(91, 214, 255, 0.9);
}

.hero-title {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.1vw, 32px);
  line-height: 1.05;
}

.hero-title span {
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ffcf70, #ff8a5c, #6ea8ff);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  color: transparent;
}

.hero-subtitle {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  max-width: 440px;
}

.hero-pills {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.hero-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  background: rgba(5, 6, 21, 0.9);
}

.hero-pill-emoji {
  font-size: 13px;
}

/* Tool card */

.tool-card {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.18), transparent 57%),
    radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.12), transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(10, 12, 37, 0.97), rgba(5, 6, 20, 0.98));
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.tool-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -40%;
  background-image: conic-gradient(
    from 200deg,
    rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.14),
    rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.16),
    rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.18),
    transparent 63%
  );
  opacity: 0;
  transform: scale(1.15);
  transition: opacity var(--transition-med);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.tool-card:hover::before {
  opacity: 1;
}

.tool-card-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

/* Form */

.tool-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.tool-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.tool-badge {
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 2px 9px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  border: 1px solid rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.7);
  color: var(--accent-blue);
  background: rgba(11, 21, 39, 0.95);
}

.form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
  gap: 10px 12px;
  align-items: flex-end;
}

.form-field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 5px;
}

.form-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.form-label span.required {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
}

.form-input-wrapper {
  position: relative;
}

.form-input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 11px;
  border-radius: 11px;
  border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
  background: var(--input-bg);
  color: var(--text-main);
  font-size: 13px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color var(--transition-fast),
    box-shadow var(--transition-fast),
    background var(--transition-fast),
    transform 90ms ease-out;
  appearance: none;
}

.form-input::placeholder {
  color: rgba(154, 154, 181, 0.7);
}

.form-input:focus {
  border-color: var(--input-border-focus);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.4);
  transform: translateY(-0.5px);
}

/* Simple fake location suggestion overlay */

.location-suggestions {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: calc(100% + 4px);
  background: rgba(6, 7, 27, 0.98);
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
  padding: 4px;
  font-size: 12px;
  z-index: 5;
  display: none;
}

.location-suggestions.visible {
  display: block;
}

.location-suggestions button {
  width: 100%;
  text-align: left;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  font: inherit;
}

.location-suggestions button:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  color: var(--text-main);
}

/* CTA */

.button-primary {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 13px;
  border: 0;
  padding: 11px 14px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: pointer;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcf70, #ff8a5c);
  color: #050509;
  box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 164, 81, 0.45);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  transition: transform var(--transition-fast),
    box-shadow var(--transition-fast), filter var(--transition-fast),
    background-position 220ms ease-out;
  background-size: 120% 120%;
  background-position: 0% 50%;
}

.button-primary span {
  font-size: 16px;
}

.button-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  filter: saturate(1.05);
  background-position: 100% 50%;
}

.button-primary:active {
  transform: translateY(0);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
}

/* Helper row */

.tool-meta {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.tool-meta-pill {
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

/* Results */

.results-wrapper {
  margin-top: 16px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(6, 8, 29, 0.97), rgba(5, 6, 24, 0.98));
  padding: 12px 12px 10px;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(8px);
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity var(--transition-med), transform var(--transition-med);
}

.results-wrapper.visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
  pointer-events: auto;
}

.results-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.results-title {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.results-pill {
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 2px 9px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.results-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 6px;
}

.result-card {
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 8px 8px 7px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07), transparent 60%),
    rgba(6, 8, 30, 0.98);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.result-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -40%;
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent 55%);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 300ms ease-out;
}

.result-card.pop-in::before {
  opacity: 1;
}

.result-title-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.result-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: rgba(224, 224, 246, 0.9);
}

.result-emoji {
  font-size: 16px;
}

.result-sign {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.result-meta {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* Internal links section */

.internal-links {
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.internal-links a {
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  background: rgba(7, 9, 31, 0.95);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: border-color var(--transition-fast),
    background var(--transition-fast),
    color var(--transition-fast),
    transform var(--transition-fast);
}

.internal-links a:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.5);
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

/* Simple content pages */

.content-page {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding-top: 32px;
}

.content-card {
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 22px 22px 24px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(10, 12, 37, 0.98), rgba(5, 6, 21, 0.98));
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
}

.content-title {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.content-subtitle {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.content-body {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* Footer */

.site-footer {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  padding: 14px 16px 18px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  background: linear-gradient(
    to top,
    rgba(3, 4, 18, 0.96),
    rgba(3, 4, 18, 0.86),
    transparent
  );
}

.site-footer-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-width);
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.footer-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}

.footer-links a {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  transition: background var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast);
}

.footer-links a:hover {
  color: var(--text-main);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

/* Responsive */

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .hero-grid {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .site-main {
    padding-top: 12px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .site-header-inner {
    padding-inline: 12px;
  }
  .site-main {
    padding: 12px 12px 32px;
  }
  .tool-card {
    padding: 14px 14px 13px;
  }
  .form-grid {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .results-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 5px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .results-grid {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
}
```

