ers.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;">Your Sun sign represents your main identity and life force. Your Moon sign reveals your inner feelings and emotional needs. Your Rising sign (or Ascendant) is the first impression you give and the lens through which you experience life.</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;">Knowing all three helps you better understand yourself, your relationships, and your path forward.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section id="comp-mc1dp1y313" tabindex="-1" class="Oqnisf comp-mc1dp1y313 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mc1dp1y313" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mc1dp1y313" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mc1dp1y313" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mc1dp1y313" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mc1dp1y313inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mc1dp1y313inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><section id="comp-mc1dp1y322" class="comp-mc1dp1y322 CohWsy wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mc1dp1y322" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mc1dp1y322" class="if7Vw2 GdhNyQ"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="tcElKx i1tH8h"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mc1dp1y322" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mc1dp1y322" class="wG8dni"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="V5AUxf"><div id="comp-mc1dp1y41" class="comp-mc1dp1y41 YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mc1dp1y41" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mc1dp1y41" class="MW5IWV"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LWbAav Kv1aVt"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mc1dp1y41" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mc1dp1y41" class="VgO9Yg"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mc1dp1y41inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mc1dp1y41inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mc1dp1y48" class="ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-mc1dp1y48 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:28px;"><span style="font-size:28px;" 