r="auto" id="viewer-atf0a"><span class="YYDY2"><span>Not exactly. Your Sun, Moon, and Rising signs are the foundation of your astrology chart, but a full birth chart (also called a natal chart) goes much deeper. Your full chart includes all the planets, zodiac signs, houses, and aspects that work together to shape your personality, relationships, career, and life path.</span></span></p><div class="UdGBv wlASV SOL3p" dir="auto" id="viewer-7efh6"><span class="YYDY2"><br role="presentation"/></span></div><p class="UdGBv wlASV SOL3p" style="line-height:max(0.8em, 1.38em)" dir="auto" id="viewer-7hhbo"><span class="YYDY2"><span>While your Big Three give you powerful insight into who you are, your complete birth chart reveals the full picture - including planetary positions, house placements, and how everything connects through aspects. For the most detailed astrology reading, exploring your full natal chart is the way to go.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="s__7arzZi orqXLWt---size-5-small orqXLWt---theme-3-box sM45uD8"><button id="4e89710d-272c-4a3b-ae23-e9a3cb8d98c5" class="sEvLmiB has-custom-focus" data-hook="accordion-item-header" aria-controls="4e89710d-272c-4a3b-ae23-e9a3cb8d98c5-item-content-813" aria-expanded="false"><div class="sdFo7rg"><div class="ss_xluw"><div class="s__5H_FIV" data-hook="accordion-item-header-content"><div class="s__8U_XjB"><h3 class="sum_lkg" data-hook="title">What’s the Difference Between Sun, Moon, and Rising Signs?</h3></div><div class="sAM_BuZ"></div></div><div class="slHDEik" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="24" height="24" class="spmcv9_" data-hook="expandIcon" data-label="Expand-ChevronDown"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18.2546728,8.18171329 L18.9617796,8.88882007 L12.5952867,15.2537133 L12.5978964,15.2558012 L11.8907896,15.962908 L11.8882867,15.9607133 L11.8874628,15.9617796 L11.180356,15.2546728 L11.1812867,15.2527133 L4.81828671,8.88882007 L5.52